{"seq":2,"slug":"babel-and-swc","title":"Babel 与 SWC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/babel-and-swc","wordCount":788,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"babel-与-swc\">Babel 与 SWC</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Babel 与 SWC 都属于「转译器」（Transpiler）——把新语法降级为旧语法，而不是像打包器那样合并模块。两者共享同一条管线：Parse（源码 → AST）→ Transform（AST → AST′）→ Generate（AST′ → 代码）。差异在实现语言：Babel 用 JavaScript 编写、以插件生态和可编程性见长；SWC 用 Rust 编写、兼容 Babel 的常见转换但速度快得多。Polyfill 策略（按需注入 vs 全量引入）是使用这类工具时的另一个核心决策点。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"两代-javascript-转译器\">两代 JavaScript 转译器</h2><p>Babel 和 SWC 代表了 JavaScript 转译器的两个时代。Babel 于 2014 年诞生（最初名为 6to5），用 JavaScript 编写，开创了&quot;插件驱动的代码转换&quot;范式；SWC 于 2019 年发布，用 Rust 编写，在保持功能兼容的同时将转译速度提升了 20 倍以上。两者的设计理念一脉相承，但实现路径截然不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Babel - JavaScript 实现&#10;        B_PARSE[babel-parser&lt;br/&gt;JS AST 解析]&#10;        B_TRAVERSE[babel-traverse&lt;br/&gt;AST 遍历]&#10;        B_GENERATE[babel-generator&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]&#10;        B_PARSE --&gt; B_TRAVERSE --&gt; B_GENERATE&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph SWC - Rust 实现&#10;        S_PARSE[swc_ecma_parser&lt;br/&gt;Rust AST 解析]&#10;        S_TRANSFORM[swc_ecma_transforms&lt;br/&gt;Rust 转换]&#10;        S_CODEGEN[swc_ecma_codegen&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]&#10;        S_PARSE --&gt; S_TRANSFORM --&gt; S_CODEGEN&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Babel - JavaScript 实现\n        B_PARSE[babel-parser&lt;br/&gt;JS AST 解析]\n        B_TRAVERSE[babel-traverse&lt;br/&gt;AST 遍历]\n        B_GENERATE[babel-generator&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]\n        B_PARSE --&gt; B_TRAVERSE --&gt; B_GENERATE\n    end\n    subgraph SWC - Rust 实现\n        S_PARSE[swc_ecma_parser&lt;br/&gt;Rust AST 解析]\n        S_TRANSFORM[swc_ecma_transforms&lt;br/&gt;Rust 转换]\n        S_CODEGEN[swc_ecma_codegen&lt;br/&gt;代码生成]\n        S_PARSE --&gt; S_TRANSFORM --&gt; S_CODEGEN\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"babel-核心架构\">Babel 核心架构</h2><p>Babel 的架构由三个核心组件构成：解析器（Parser）、转换器（Transformer）和生成器（Generator）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"编译流程\">编译流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    SRC[源代码] --&gt; PARSE[Parse&lt;br/&gt;源码 → AST]&#10;    PARSE --&gt; TRANSFORM[Transform&lt;br/&gt;AST → AST&#39;]&#10;    TRANSFORM --&gt; GENERATE[Generate&lt;br/&gt;AST&#39; → 输出代码]&#10;    GENERATE --&gt; OUT[目标代码]\">flowchart LR\n    SRC[源代码] --&gt; PARSE[Parse&lt;br/&gt;源码 → AST]\n    PARSE --&gt; TRANSFORM[Transform&lt;br/&gt;AST → AST']\n    TRANSFORM --&gt; GENERATE[Generate&lt;br/&gt;AST' → 输出代码]\n    GENERATE --&gt; OUT[目标代码]</pre><h3 id=\"preset-与-plugin\">Preset 与 Plugin</h3><p>Babel 的转换能力完全由插件（Plugin）提供。Preset 是一组预配置的插件集合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;presets&quot;: [&#10;    [&#10;      &quot;@babel/preset-env&quot;,&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;targets&quot;: &quot;&gt; 0.25%, not dead&quot;,&#10;        &quot;useBuiltIns&quot;: &quot;usage&quot;,&#10;        &quot;corejs&quot;: &quot;3.36&quot;,&#10;        &quot;modules&quot;: false&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    [&#10;      &quot;@babel/preset-react&quot;,&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;runtime&quot;: &quot;automatic&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;@babel/preset-typescript&quot;&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;plugins&quot;: [&#10;    [&quot;@babel/plugin-proposal-decorators&quot;, { &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2023-11&quot; }],&#10;    &quot;@babel/plugin-proposal-explicit-resource-management&quot;&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"presets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@babel/preset-env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"> 0.25%, not dead\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"useBuiltIns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"corejs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.36\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"modules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@babel/preset-react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"runtime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"automatic\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"@babel/preset-typescript\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@babel/plugin-proposal-decorators\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2023-11\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"@babel/plugin-proposal-explicit-resource-management\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Preset</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@babel/preset-env</code></td>\n<td>根据目标环境自动确定所需转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@babel/preset-react</code></td>\n<td>JSX 转换和 React 优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@babel/preset-typescript</code></td>\n<td>TypeScript 语法剥离（不做类型检查）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@babel/preset-flow</code></td>\n<td>Flow 类型注解剥离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"babel-preset-env-的工作原理\">@babel/preset-env 的工作原理</h3><p>preset-env 是 Babel 最重要的 Preset。它根据目标环境（browserslist）自动选择需要的转换插件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    TARGETS[目标环境&lt;br/&gt;browserslist]&#10;    COMPAT[兼容性数据&lt;br/&gt;compat-table]&#10;    FEATURES[需要的特性列表]&#10;    PLUGINS[选择的插件列表]&#10;&#10;    TARGETS --&gt; COMPAT&#10;    COMPAT --&gt; FEATURES&#10;    FEATURES --&gt; PLUGINS\">flowchart TD\n    TARGETS[目标环境&lt;br/&gt;browserslist]\n    COMPAT[兼容性数据&lt;br/&gt;compat-table]\n    FEATURES[需要的特性列表]\n    PLUGINS[选择的插件列表]\n\n    TARGETS --&gt; COMPAT\n    COMPAT --&gt; FEATURES\n    FEATURES --&gt; PLUGINS</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// .browserslistrc&#10;// &gt; 0.25%&#10;// not dead&#10;// not ie 11&#10;&#10;// Babel 会自动确定：&#10;// - 箭头函数：不需要转换（所有目标都支持）&#10;// - Optional Chaining：需要转换（部分目标不支持）&#10;// - Class Fields：需要转换\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .browserslistrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// > 0.25%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// not dead</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// not ie 11</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Babel 会自动确定：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 箭头函数：不需要转换（所有目标都支持）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - Optional Chaining：需要转换（部分目标不支持）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - Class Fields：需要转换</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义-babel-插件\">自定义 Babel 插件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export default function myBabelPlugin({ types: t }) {&#10;  return {&#10;    visitor: {&#10;      CallExpression(path) {&#10;        if (path.node.callee.type === &#39;MemberExpression&#39; &amp;&amp; path.node.callee.object.name === &#39;console&#39;) {&#10;          if (process.env.NODE_ENV === &#39;production&#39;) {&#10;            path.remove();&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> myBabelPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    visitor: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      CallExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (path.node.callee.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MemberExpression'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> path.node.callee.object.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'console'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"swc-核心特性\">SWC 核心特性</h2><p>SWC（Speedy Web Compiler）用 Rust 编写，提供了与 Babel 功能相当但速度快得多的转译能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能对比\">性能对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>Babel</th>\n<th>SWC</th>\n<th>倍数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单文件转译</td>\n<td>12ms</td>\n<td>0.5ms</td>\n<td>~24x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000 个文件并行</td>\n<td>8.2s</td>\n<td>0.4s</td>\n<td>~20x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 项目完整转译</td>\n<td>15s</td>\n<td>0.8s</td>\n<td>~19x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"swc-配置\">SWC 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://swc.rs/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;jsc&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;parser&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;syntax&quot;: &quot;typescript&quot;,&#10;      &quot;tsx&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;decorators&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;dynamicImport&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;transform&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;react&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;runtime&quot;: &quot;automatic&quot;,&#10;        &quot;importSource&quot;: &quot;react&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;decoratorVersion&quot;: &quot;2022-03&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;es2020&quot;,&#10;    &quot;minify&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;compress&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;mangle&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;es6&quot;,&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;noInterop&quot;: false&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;minify&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;sourceMaps&quot;: true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://swc.rs/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#