tyle=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    react</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      tsDecorators: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"babel-vs-swc-选型指南\">Babel vs SWC 选型指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START{选择转译器}&#10;    CUSTOM{需要自定义&lt;br/&gt;Babel 插件?}&#10;    LEGACY{需要支持&lt;br/&gt;旧版特性?}&#10;    PERF{性能敏感?}&#10;&#10;    START --&gt; CUSTOM&#10;    CUSTOM --&gt;|是| BABEL[Babel]&#10;    CUSTOM --&gt;|否| LEGACY&#10;    LEGACY --&gt;|是| BABEL&#10;    LEGACY --&gt;|否| PERF&#10;    PERF --&gt;|是| SWC[SWC]&#10;    PERF --&gt;|否| EITHER[两者皆可&lt;br/&gt;推荐 SWC]\">flowchart TD\n    START{选择转译器}\n    CUSTOM{需要自定义&lt;br/&gt;Babel 插件?}\n    LEGACY{需要支持&lt;br/&gt;旧版特性?}\n    PERF{性能敏感?}\n\n    START --&gt; CUSTOM\n    CUSTOM --&gt;|是| BABEL[Babel]\n    CUSTOM --&gt;|否| LEGACY\n    LEGACY --&gt;|是| BABEL\n    LEGACY --&gt;|否| PERF\n    PERF --&gt;|是| SWC[SWC]\n    PERF --&gt;|否| EITHER[两者皆可&lt;br/&gt;推荐 SWC]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Babel</th>\n<th>SWC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>~20x 更快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插件生态</td>\n<td>极其丰富</td>\n<td>内置常用转换，自定义插件需要 Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义插件</td>\n<td>JavaScript，门槛低</td>\n<td>Rust 或 WASM，门槛高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>剥离类型（不检查）</td>\n<td>剥离类型（不检查）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSX</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polyfill</td>\n<td>@babel/preset-env + core-js</td>\n<td>内置部分 polyfill 方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS-in-JS</td>\n<td>styled-components 插件等</td>\n<td>styled-components 插件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟度</td>\n<td>10+ 年，极其成熟</td>\n<td>5+ 年，快速成熟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"两者的互补使用\">两者的互补使用</h2><p>在某些项目中，可以同时使用 Babel 和 SWC 各取所长：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 使用 SWC 做主要转译（速度快）&#10;// 使用 Babel 做特殊的自定义转换&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  module: {&#10;    rules: [&#10;      {&#10;        test: /\\.tsx?$/,&#10;        exclude: /node_modules/,&#10;        use: [&#10;          {&#10;            loader: &#39;babel-loader&#39;,&#10;            options: {&#10;              plugins: [&#39;my-custom-babel-plugin&#39;],&#10;            },&#10;          },&#10;          {&#10;            loader: &#39;swc-loader&#39;,&#10;            options: {&#10;              jsc: {&#10;                parser: { syntax: &#39;typescript&#39;, tsx: true },&#10;                target: &#39;es2020&#39;,&#10;              },&#10;            },&#10;          },&#10;        ],&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 SWC 做主要转译（速度快）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 Babel 做特殊的自定义转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">tsx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        exclude:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">node_modules</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        use: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            loader: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'babel-loader'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            options: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'my-custom-babel-plugin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            loader: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'swc-loader'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            options: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              jsc: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                parser: { syntax: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tsx: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'es2020'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"polyfill-策略\">Polyfill 策略</h2><h3 id=\"babel-的-polyfill-方案\">Babel 的 Polyfill 方案</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;presets&quot;: [&#10;    [&#10;      &quot;@babel/preset-env&quot;,&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;useBuiltIns&quot;: &quot;usage&quot;,&#10;        &quot;corejs&quot;: &quot;3.36&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"presets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@babel/preset-env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"useBuiltIns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"corejs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.36\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>useBuiltIns 值</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>不自动添加 polyfill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entry</code></td>\n<td>在入口处展开为所有目标环境需要的 polyfill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>usage</code></td>\n<td>按需导入实际使用的 API 的 polyfill</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"swc-的-polyfill-方案\">SWC 的 Polyfill 方案</h3><p>SWC 通过 <code>swc-plugin-transform-imports</code> 和外部 polyfill 库实现类似功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;jsc&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;target&quot;: &quot;es5&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;env&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;targets&quot;: &quot;&gt; 0.25%, not dead&quot;,&#10;    &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;usage&quot;,&#10;    &quot;coreJs&quot;: &quot;3.36&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"jsc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"es5\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"> 0.25%, not dead\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"coreJs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.36\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Babel 用 JavaScript 编写，开创了插件驱动的代码转换范式，生态极其丰富。</li>\n<li>SWC 用 Rust 编写，速度是 Babel 的 20 倍以上，已被 Vite、Next.js 等广泛采用。</li>\n<li>preset-env 根据 browserslist 自动确定需要的转换，避免不必要的代码膨胀。</li>\n<li>选型建议：需要自定义 Babel 插件时用 Babel，否则推荐 SWC。</li>\n<li>Polyfill 策略（usage vs entry）直接影响产物体积。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Babel 与 SWC","id":"babel-与-swc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两代 JavaScript 转译器","id":"两代-javascript-转译器"},{"level":2,"text":"Babel 核心架构","id":"babel-核心架构"},{"level":3,"text":"编译流程","id":"编译流程"},{"level":3,"text":"Preset 与 Plugin","id":"preset-与-plugin"},{"level":3,"text":"@babel/preset-env 的工作原理","id":"babel-preset-env-的工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义 Babel 插件","id":"自定义-babel-插件"},{"level":2,"text":"SWC 核心特性","id":"swc-核心特性"},{"level":3,"text":"性能对比","id":"性能对比"},{"level":3,"text":"SWC 配置","id":"swc-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"SWC 的 API 使用","id":"swc-的-api-使用"},{"level":3,"text":"SWC 在打包器中的集成","id":"swc-在打包器中的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Babel vs SWC 选型指南","id":"babel-vs-swc-选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"两者的互补使用","id":"两者的互补使用"},{"level":2,"text":"Polyfill 策略","id":"polyfill-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Babel 的 Polyfill 方案","id":"babel-的-polyfill-方案"},{"level":3,"text":"SWC 的 Polyfill 方案","id":"swc-的-polyfill-方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"tsc 与 TypeScript 编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/tsc-and-typescript-compilation"},"next":{"title":"PostCSS 与 CSS 处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/compilers-and-transpilers/postcss-and-css-processing"}}